			"faq_ownwallet_bullet_2": "<strong>Receive payments</strong> to your connected wallet's address. When creating a receive request, select your connected wallet as the destination.",
			"faq_ownwallet_bullet_3": "<strong>See all your balances</strong> in one place — the total balance card at the top of the Connected tab shows the combined value across all your wallets.",
			"faq_ownwallet_footer": "Your wallet stays connected between visits. The app never has access to your private keys — you confirm every transaction in your wallet."
		},
